    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LIANE: Yeah a friend’s wedding. We were both sitting at the singles table. It was us, an eighty-year-old fireman and.. and a nerdy biology student …\nANNA: How long ago?\nLIANE: Umm... it’s been...",
      "LIANE: 94 days.\nANNA: Oh... Nice. Do you think to test?",
      "CARRIE: I completely understand. We did the test when it was created but especially when you have a four- year-old child, it's really hard to decide…\nANNA: Will you do it again?",
      "ALEXANDRA: Trevor's office is over there. Let me know if you need anything else.\nANNA: Thanks.",
      "SALLY: Okay. Thank you.\nANNA: They seem so good together. I may be wrong, but I think they have something real."
    ]
  },
